# [FABLE-5] sq-xg6uu ledger entry (the sq-pbz04.1 disposition precedent).
disposition: PERMANENT
reason: sparq deliberately does not fire the scm-cls typing expansion on `C rdf:type owl:Class` (C subClassOf C, C equivalentClass C, C subClassOf owl:Thing — and the downstream `x rdf:type owl:Thing` those Thing-edges feed via cax-sco): the same documented no-axiomatic/no-reflexive-triples posture as its RDFS profile (they add no useful inferences and explode the store). owlrl emits the full scm-cls set. A known, deliberate RL-subset boundary, not a soundness bug.
oracle-only: <http://ex.org/Animal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://ex.org/Animal> .
oracle-only: <http://ex.org/Animal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
oracle-only: <http://ex.org/Animal> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <http://ex.org/Animal> .
